UPDATE claim:cc07_0019_08 SET text = string::replace(text, "mid-month sunrise 06:42 and sunset 18:32.", "mid-month sunrise 05:42 and sunset 17:32 (Kyiv time, before the clocks went forward on 26 March)."), confidence_note = "Clock corrected (2026-10-14): the reanalysis times were taken on UTC+3, which is Moscow time in winter; Ukraine keeps EET (UTC+2) from the last Sunday of October to the last Sunday of March. Recomputed with the NOAA solar equations; the corrected times are the recorded ones less one hour." WHERE text CONTAINS "mid-month sunrise 06:42 and sunset 18:32.";
