UPDATE passage:c12_0017 SET markdown = string::replace(markdown, "Sunset was at 18:03 Kyiv time, and the moon was near full. If HUR's 18:45 is Kyiv time (the source does not say), the kill came in dusk, which fits the crash videos", "Sunset was at 17:03 Kyiv time (18:03 Moscow time, the local clock), and the moon was near full. If HUR's 18:45 is Moscow time, the kill came in nautical twilight, at dusk, which fits the crash videos; on Kyiv time it came in full dark (the source does not say which)") WHERE markdown CONTAINS "Sunset was at 18:03 Kyiv time, and the moon was near full. If HUR's 18:45 is Kyiv time (the source does not say), the kill came in dusk, which fits the crash videos";
